   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The nurse starts to discuss the diet and exercise recommendations with Mr. Thompson, but he insists he is following a heart-healthy diet and that the tests are wrong. What food selection in Mr. Thompson’s 24-hour diet recall illustrates inaccuracy in his statement?",
